  <AltText>
    Amazing Artfight attack of our headmate, Antiainehunt Õudus (or 'Antiaine' for short), from Mat André. Antiaine is a protogen wolf with purple fur with green highlights. It is reaching its paw out towards the viewer, and appears to be bursting out of the background. As is usual for a protogen, Antiaine is covered with armour that is adorned with green detailing. It's wearing quite the smirk on its face.
  </AltText>
  <Description>
    The protogen wolf Antiainehunt Õudus leaping forward summoning unknown powers from digiphysical reality!
  </Description>
