  <Notes>
    I just couldn't resist revenging your pixelatious Lark piece with an attack on Antiainehunt! I hope I didn't go too far with my interpretations of their design--if you'd like me to change anything at all, pease don't hesitate to let me know!!
    You can find the Full Res version Here: https://nhs06d2.sharing.bublup.com/ui/landing_page?item_id=001-i-0f89331a-cbfb-4c02-b603-68455e478b19
    and the Timelapse MP4 here: https://nhs06d2.sharing.bublup.com/ui/landing_page?item_id=001-i-615b87bc-3686-4703-a0c0-39e70b93df97
    Also, I'm not sure if I mentioned before with Ragiähl, but I have sub-series of the Warped Worlds TCG/IP called "Nexus Guests" where other OCs and worlds are featured as characters, items, powers, etc in our game a sort of crossover guest. Currently, it's still in development, but I have a Nexus Guest card concept for another creator's OC and/or I could make up a rouch concept for Ragiahl, Antiainehunt, or any other OC you may like to see. Right now, it would be voluntary and for fun (and not for direct sale), but I would love to be able to work out a deal if we eventually sell the Nexus Guest cards where the creators would get paid for cards sold with their creations.
    ZERO pressure or obligation at all, but if you want to talk about it more, you can message me here or on Discord or Bluesky! :)
    Thanks for allowing me the opporunity to draw another one of your amazing OCs!
    Stay Wonderful!
    💫✌️⚔️
  </Notes>
